{
  // Anville Town (plan 22 · U6, part c): Black 2's quiet town at the end of the Gear Station's line, round its turntable
  // and the old cars on its sidings, our words. Nobody walks here: the train from Nimbasa's Gear Station brings the
  // player to its station, and the station agent (2) sends them back (anville_town.txt). On a Saturday or a Sunday the
  // town fills with train fans and collectors (4 to 6, 8 to 10, 12 to 14, FLAG_UNOVA_HIDE_ANVILLE_WEEKEND, which the
  // town's arrival clears at the weekend); the collectors' trades of Black 2 only talk of themselves. The lost Pansage
  // (15, Black 2's 0x0362) and the girl's errand are left
  "area": "anville_town",
